<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Proffitt's rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Proffitt's rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Daniel Blanchard initiated coverage of Proffitt's Inc with a buy on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 39-1/4.  </p>
<p>-- In a research report, Blanchard gave the company a 12-month price target of $50 and estimated a five-year earnings per share growth rate of 20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lehman also expects the company to acquire &quot;north of an additional $1.2 billion in sales through 2000&quot; in addition to current annualized run-rate of $2.3 billion.</p>
</text>
